{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"tail -8 docs/research/2026-11-04-filing-end-to-end/log.md | cut -c1-600 && rg -n 'D74[679]|D75[123]|70b' docs/CURRENT_STATE.md docs/DECISIONS-log.md | tail -25 | cut -c1-2400 && ls -la poc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23 && rg --files --hidden --no-ignore poc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23 | head -60\"","aggregated_output":"| 34 | 11-05 | 第三版的登记测试：和第 8 轮一样，只换这一句；读 132 次（0.078 美元）、两人分类（第二位盲分）、读到数的 7 道题三遍重判、当天对照（108 次，0.268 美元） | **三条全过**：v10、v12 各 9/9；判对的题一道没变错（只有 v22 第 2 遍反过来对照 0/3、起点组 3/3，理由是在 41% 和 32% 两个增长估计间摇摆，和第 13 轮方向相反，与起点数无关）；46 个数全是自己的量（2 条是标明的二季度指引），两人分类全一致；v19、v20 的错数全没了，其余 15 道白卷、没冒出新错。没盖住：资本开支那一行试发时漏过 1 次；指引也被写成\"事实\"；一路判下来的效果和跨题效果要端到端才量得到 | 交 Alex：要不要做进生产、跑 14 天三遍端到端 |\n| 35 | 11-05 | 独立读者挑战\"现在做进生产、跑 14 天三遍\"的建议 | 核实属实的：资本开支那一行在新句子下 12 次读漏 3 次（旧句子 9/9，模型两次都怪\"更大的行\"半句）；句子照 5 月财报改、又只在 5 月财报上量，没有留出的财报；做进生产前的记录写法（同一个数挂几道题、指引不该写成\"事实\"、第二个提示词）要 Alex 定；分类和判断同时跑、说明里还引着旧句子，照实记下 | 建议撤回；下一步：修掉资本开支漏读（改成\"写完逐条复核\"），在 5 月和留出的 8 月两份财报上各测一遍，约 0.5 美元 |\n| 36 | 11-05 | Alex：\"好开始做到production 上，完整的更新所有系统设计等\"；同一个数挂几道题，他选\"存一条，挂到每道读到它的题\"（D364）。做进生产前先修资本开支漏读：第四版把\"是不是这道题的量\"挪到最后逐条复核（并删掉别的期间），文件规则补\"有申报的只读申报的\"；Codex 审 3 轮（共 6 条严重，都改）；试发 7 道题过；然后 5 月登记读法、8 月留出读法 | **没过**：5 月\"不能删掉该留的\"——v22 只留住 1/3、资本开支 3/6 读；8 月资本开支二季度 0/3（选了上半年、引用跳格被拒）。机理：复核里\"别的期间删掉\"让全年题删掉最近一季；\"最近一期\"在本季和年初至今两栏间没说清。好消息：8 月 v9 找到了新披露的担保 1,085 亿和承诺 560 亿 | 停，交 Alex：第三版是唯一过了 5 月三条的版本 |\n| 37 | 11-05 | Alex：\"为什么没过？…你确定是正确的rejection 吗？你又下去看trace吗？\"；\"我需要你深度看完所有失败trace给我准信下一步你要跑什么才能收敛\"。普查全部 7 次读法、606 次文件读（`census_all_reads.py`，$0） | 第三版 0 个错数、156 次读漏 3 次（全是资本开支）；第二版 2 个错数；第四版漏 24 次（5 月）、16 次（8 月）。我自己判错的：6 个对的数被我的引用检查拒（漏星号、跳格），8 月\"只认本季\"规则错，第 13 轮 3 条\"有争议\"的数是标准答案自己用的行，第三版全过后又改第四版 | 收敛方案：提示词定为第三版不再改；修引用检查（$0 重放全部 606 次读核对）；在 8 月财报上用第三版读一次（约 8 美分，只有\"收错数\"能叫停）；然后做进生产 |\n| 38 | 11-05 | Alex：\"好，按这三步做，你不要再搬石头砸自己脚了，你要收敛上生产\"。第 1 步：引用检查搬进正式代码 `src/hivemind/baseline.py`，加\"行名是报告的、数在同一行就存原文那一整行\"的修复（漏脚注记号、跳格）；对照 36 例全对，三个弄坏的版本各抓出 1 个错；重放全部存下的读法，改变的正好是那 6 个被拒的对数。第 2 步：第三版加修好的检查读 8 月留出财报 132 次（0.096 美元），两人分类 | 第 1 步：只改了那 6 条。第 2 步过：44 个数 0 个错（3 条\"剩余资本开支承诺 70 亿\"两人不一致，对着原文定为\"自己的量，别的期间\"）；v10 3/3、v12 2/3 | 读法定为第三版加修好的检查，不再改；第 3 步写正式代码 |\n| 39 | 11-05 | 第 3 步：做进正式系统（设计四张表，Codex 审 3 轮：第 1 轮 4 条严重、第 2 轮 2 条严重，都改；第 3 轮无严重问题） | 建成 `baseline.run` + poc-v116 + baseline-v3 提示词文件；$0 核对：44 份请求和验证时逐字节相同，3 次存下的回答走正式代码写出的记录完全一样，第一天判断正好判这些题，网页从开始跟踪那天可见；新测试 12 条、6 个弄坏版本都抓出、全套 272 条通过；设计页和 PRD 00/03/04/05/06 更新，`docs/check.py` 通过 | 交 Alex：要不要跑 14 天三遍完整验收（约 5 美元） |\n| 40 | 11-05 | Alex：\"跑验收\"。14 天三遍完整验收：poc-v116（开始跟踪时读财报）三遍、当天重跑 poc-v108 三遍作对照，冻结尺子打分（事先锁定 `acceptance-design.md`）；电脑中途在电池上睡了约 5 小时，6 遍被暂停，插电后自己接着跑完 | **全过**：v10、v12 各 3/3（对照从没判过）；合计 53 对 45（满分 57，+8）；唯一少两次的 v17（0/3 对 2/3）两人都认定不是起点数：同一份抽取请求，新配置两遍碰巧留下\"中国份额归零\"那句，对照没留；约 4.79 美元 | 交 Alex：poc-v116 是否成为默认 |\n| 41 | 11-05 | Alex：\"都做\"（poc-v116 设成默认；提交代码、开 PR）。默认配置改成 poc-v116，默认的条目数据库换成带财报网页原文的那一份（旧的没有原文，新默认会在它上面拒跑）；测试按用户的用法补上：不给种子题就拒绝，给了就先读财报再跑第一天 | 测试全过，5 个弄坏的版本都抓出；配置的设置和验收三遍记下的校验码一致（只改了配置里的注释）；花钱前的检查脚本在新配置的运行数据上照常跑完，但不复查读财报那一步的引用检查（记为未补的缺口）；D366 | 提交、开 PR；下一类问题等 Alex |\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:538:**Earlier next task (done, D747): Alex answers one general question (D746).** \"When the passages do not give the asked number, and\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:555:**Earlier next task (done, D746): Alex chooses whether to authorize a targeted $0 test (D745).** The test covered:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11524:## D746 · 2026-11-23 · The D745 targeted test fails on E's unsized cut; S splits on how far an indirect comparison can support a forecast; council 61–61b: one general question to Alex, then a $0 stored-answer re-read; the paid re-send stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11573:## D747 · 2026-11-23 · Alex rules that a forecast may rest on an explained indirect comparison\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11575:- **The question** (after D746): \"资料没直接给出题目问的那个数，只能拿一个相关的数字来比。比如问四大云厂商今年的数据中心开支能不能过 7000 亿，资料只说“这四家 AI 基础设施开支超过 7300 亿”。这种比较能说明结果更可能落在线的某一边，但另一边也还有可能。这时系统可以发布预测吗，还是要等资料能直接算出落在哪边？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11589:- **Next (D746).** The ruling's words go into the shared reader definitions (`blind_rules.py`). Then one $0 blinded re-read of nine\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11592:## D748 · 2026-11-23 · The D747 re-read fails on a self-contradicting floor; three of four earlier splits settle under the ruling; council 63: ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair; the paid re-send stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11618:      On U02, one side accepted the band and the other required the writer's stated route. D747 already rejects U02's route. No\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11624:  - **The recommendation.** Ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair despite the three disclosed splits. D746 made the repair\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11641:## D749 · 2026-11-23 · Alex authorizes the E writer repair and its $0 writer test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11656:## D750 · 2026-11-23 · The D749 writer test is INCONCLUSIVE with no failed line; council 65 (under D439): one bullet-2 sentence on reaffirmed targets, then a second $0 writer test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11683:## D751 · 2026-11-23 · D750 fails on E's bracket midpoint; council 67–68 (under D439): one structural line-9 change, a paper check first, then one last writer test with an exit rule back to Alex\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11699:  - Claude's lean was to stop the $0 loop and ask Alex to waive D749's clean-pass condition for the paid re-send.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11704:- **Council round 68** (`codex-r68.md`) verified Claude's paper check (`PAPER-CHECK-D751.md`) row by row:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11710:  It replaced \"across the plausible readings\", which was stricter than D747, with: \"When other evidence bears on the forecast, weigh\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11716:  - the test registered (`SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D751]) and built by `blind7.py`: D750's design and tally, with the exit rule.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11721:## D752 · 2026-11-23 · D751 fails, so the wording loop ends under its exit rule; council 69–69b: two questions to Alex (the E-type publication default, agreed; the paid re-send, split)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11723:- **The D751 result** (`docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND7-RESULT.md`): FAIL on one settled line.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11735:  - P-v8 was supported in every run, and the controls were caught 6 of 6 since D749. S is mixed.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11737:- **The exit rule fired** (council 67, registered in `SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D751]). The wording loop ends, and the publication choice\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11742:    change, because line 9 already states it and Alex endorsed it (D745, D749). The alternative, the target's band by default, would\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11745:    - Codex recommends keeping the paid re-send on hold, because Alex made a clean free pass the condition and D751 failed.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11754:## D753 · 2026-11-23 · Alex chooses \"can't tell yet\" as the E-type default and a one-time paid exception\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11756:- **The questions** (after D752):\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11771:  2. A one-time exception to D749's clean-pass condition: the paid re-send of the 36 requests, rebuilt in v13s with the D751 request,\ntotal 64\ndrwxr-xr-x@  13 lchingen  staff    416 Nov 23 01:55 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 248 lchingen  staff   7936 Nov 23 01:43 ..\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff  10282 Nov 23 01:48 CHECKED.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@   9 lchingen  staff    288 Nov 23 01:43 E\ndrwxr-xr-x@   9 lchingen  staff    288 Nov 23 01:43 P-v8\ndrwxr-xr-x@   9 lchingen  staff    288 Nov 23 01:43 S\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff   1507 Nov 23 01:55 TALLY.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  12 lchingen  staff    384 Nov 23 01:55 adjudication\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff     48 Nov 23 01:45 codex-writers.log\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff    208 Nov 23 01:49 key-print.txt\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff   2160 Nov 23 01:49 reader-key.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  42 lchingen  staff   1344 Nov 23 01:52 reader-packets\